{"id":32039,"title":"VDB: High-Resolution Sparse Volumes with Dynamic Topology (Academy Award Winner) [pdf]","url":"http://www.museth.org/Ken/Publications_files/Museth_TOG13.pdf","final_url":"https://www.museth.org/Ken/Publications_files/Museth_TOG13.pdf","year":2018,"kind":"link","source":"hn","doi":null,"arxiv":null,"sha256":"583421cbbf6aff73873f3b84670ac88a04c82094fddf7b8eda8472564db7a252","ctype":"application/pdf","text_src":"url","fetched_at":1793051700.2644079,"text_chars":144290,"abstract":"museth.org\n\nhttps://museth.org › Ken › Publications_files › Museth_TOG13.pdf\n\nPDF VDB: High-Resolution Sparse Volumes with Dynamic Topology - Museth\nWe have developed a novel hierarchical data structure for the efficient rep-resentation of sparse, time-varying volumetric data discretized on a 3D grid. Our \"VDB\", so named because it is a Volumetric, Dynamic grid that shares several characteristics with B+trees, exploits spatial coherency of time-varying data to separately and compactly encode data values and grid topology. VDB models a ...","file":null,"marks":["unofficial"],"links":["https://www.museth.org/Ken/Publications_files/Museth_TOG13.pdf","https://ken.museth.org/OpenVDB_files/Museth_TOG13.pdf","https://mail.museth.org/Ken/Publications_files/Museth_TOG13.pdf"],"cited_by":[{"path":"4498-sparse-vdb-sdf-generation.md","name":"Sparse VDB SDF Generation","k":1},{"path":"5238-hierarchical-ray-marching.md","name":"Hierarchical Ray Marching","k":3},{"path":"20437-delayed-loading-with-memory-mapping.md","name":"Delayed Loading with Memory Mapping","k":2},{"path":"22343-sequential-access-via-bit-mask-iteration.md","name":"Sequential Access via Bit Mask Iteration","k":1},{"path":"22363-vdb-random-access.md","name":"VDB Random Access","k":1},{"path":"22348-vdb-leafnode-structure.md","name":"VDB LeafNode Structure","k":1},{"path":"22350-vdb-rootnode-structure.md","name":"VDB RootNode Structure","k":1},{"path":"22345-hierarchical-flood-filling.md","name":"Hierarchical Floo